        {
            "text": "Users reported that when paying via UPI during peak hours, the transaction times out on the gateway side. However, our server does not receive the payment webhook before the checkout session expires. As a result, the customer's account is debited, but the order status remains 'Pending' instead of 'Completed'. The support team has received over forty complaints since Monday.",
