        {
            "text": "Last night, the nightly backup job started at 2 AM but failed halfway because the disk on the storage server was full. The job did not send an alert, so nobody noticed the failure until a customer asked for a data restore this morning. We were only able to restore data from three days ago. The team now plans to add disk monitoring and failure alerts.",
