        {
            "text": "After yesterday's app update, some Android users cannot log in with their phone number. The OTP is generated correctly, but the SMS provider rejects messages that contain our new sender ID because it has not been approved yet. Because the OTP never reaches the user, the login screen keeps waiting until it shows a timeout error. iOS users are not affected because they use email login.",
