            "text": "The mobile app crashes when a user opens the invoice screen while offline. The screen tries to read the cached invoice list, but the cache is empty for users who installed the app recently. The code does not handle an empty list, so it throws an exception and the app closes. Users who have opened invoices at least once while online do not see this crash.",
