            "text": "Customers on the yearly plan were charged again this month even though their subscription is valid until next year. A developer changed the billing cron job to run on the first day of every month, but forgot to skip customers on annual plans. Finance has already refunded twenty customers manually. The fix is ready, but it needs approval before it can be deployed.",
